# Qwen2-VL-7B-Instruct instead of Gemma-3n-E4B: sourced after the dataset, method
# and evaluation presets (scripts/run_experiments.py --model qwen2_vl_7b).
# Same wrapper as Qwen2.5-VL (tgcl/models/qwen_vl.py); hidden states after the final norm
# (Qwen2VLModel.language_model.norm), as for the other models.
VLM_MODEL=Qwen/Qwen2-VL-7B-Instruct
LAYER_PATH=model.language_model.norm
# Visual tokens per image: 28x28 px each, at most 512.
QWEN_MAX_PIXELS=401408
# Same architecture size as Qwen2.5-VL-7B (bf16 weights ~16 GiB on one RTX 3090). Unlike Qwen2.5-VL,
# Qwen2VLForConditionalGeneration.forward has no logits_to_keep, so generation computes the vocabulary
# logits (152k) of every prompt position: step 1 (full images, up to 512 visual tokens) ran out of memory
# at batch 32 (6.4 GiB of logits). Step 4 (crops, ~100 positions) and step 6 (batch 8) fit.
BATCH_SIZE=32
INFERENCE_BATCH_SIZE=8
EXPL_BATCH_SIZE=8
